Fri Nov 13 23:55:00 UTC 2026 - Ackerman-00 <noreply@example.com>

- version 0.0.0+git20261113140610.c243027-0
- Reworked from a network-at-build-time source build (which OBS cannot
  run) into the repo's standard pattern: the payload is built by the
  package's CI-side build.sh (docker fedora, upstream commit pinned in
  the spec; vcpkg still downloads its ports there, where network exists)
  and OBS repacks the tarball instead of compiling. Same git snapshot
  tracking as the other packaged builds; update.sh now only detects
  upstream movement and rebuilds the payload in CI.

