Fri Nov 13 20:30:00 UTC 2026 - Ackerman-00 <noreply@example.com>

- version 0.0.0+git20261113125931.3548021-0
- New package ladybird-unstable (upstream git master, vcpkg bundled libraries)
- Disable LTO for this build (%global _lto_cflags %{nil}): the AK final
  link fails under LTO with undefined mi_heap_malloc/mi_malloc in the
  ltrans partitions, deterministically across two builds, while the same
  link passes in an isolated repro (weak-DSO resolution under LTO is
  partition-assignment dependent). The rest of the distro flags
  (%{optflags}: -O2 -g -pipe -fstack-protector-strong) stay in place.
- Build for the x86-64-v2 baseline (upstream ENABLE_CI_BASELINE_CPU) and
  fail the build if -march=native leaks in: a native build bakes the
  builder's AVX-512 into the published libraries and every launch then
  dies with SIGILL on CPUs without it (Ryzen 5 5600G repro).
